OL,3,GNEWSACaring for husband with dementia
OL,4,A'nearly broke me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEllen Miller said she started to notice
OL,7,Fchanges in her husband Terry's
OL,8,Fbehaviour in 2016.
OL,10,FShe said his driving had become
OL,11,Ferratic, and though he was a keen cook,
OL,12,Fhe was no longer able to prepare a
OL,13,FSunday roast - something which had been
OL,14,Fan "unshakeable family ritual" for many
OL,15,Fyears.
OL,17,FBut the change that troubled Ellen most
OL,18,Fwas Terry's growing disengagement from
OL,19,Ftheir relationship.
OL,21,F"He just didn't seem bothered anymore,"
OL,22,Fshe said.
